<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>GoFormX — schema-first forms</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; background: #09100e; color: #f2f7f4; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: radial-gradient(circle at 75% 15%, #173b31 0, transparent 35%), #09100e; }
    main { width: min(68rem, 100%); padding: 2rem; }
    .eyebrow { color: #7dd3af; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { max-width: 14ch; margin: 1rem 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.5rem); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
    p { max-width: 42rem; color: #afc2ba; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.65; }
    nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    a { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #31564a; border-radius: 999px; padding: .75rem 1rem; color: #e9fff5; text-decoration: none; }
    a:first-child { border-color: #7dd3af; background: #7dd3af; color: #07100c; font-weight: 700; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="eyebrow">GoFormX control plane</div>
    <h1>Forms for people and agents.</h1>
    <p>Design schemas, publish forms, inspect immutable submissions, and manage integrations through one ownership-aware interface. The dashboard is under active development.</p>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="/api/auth/register">Create account</a>
      <a href="/api/auth/login">Sign in</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/goformx/goformx">API source</a>
    </nav>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
